{
  "_about": "The token tree build_tokens.py turns into tokens.json. FlowMapp's two public surfaces declare separate vocabularies on :root (raw/css-vars.json): core.* carries the marketing site's flat legacy palette plus the Webflow _apps variable layer (including the declared but never-painted -dark twins), app.* carries the SPA's --primary-*/--secondary-*/--neutral-gray-* ramp that the signed-out auth forms and the public share viewer paint. Measured roles alias to the declared values they match, inside their own surface set.",
